#
#	An EXCERPT of pci.ids, Version 2026.02.12, as shipped by the `pci.ids`
#	package on Ubuntu resolute at /usr/share/misc/pci.ids. Every line below is
#	copied verbatim; nothing has been reformatted.
#
#	It is here so that the parser is checked against the real file's quirks —
#	two spaces between id and name, one tab for a device, TWO tabs for a
#	subsystem (which this module deliberately does not keep), a separate class
#	section introduced by "C xx", and names that contain spaces, brackets,
#	commas and apostrophes.
#
106b  Apple Inc.
	0007  O'Hare I/O
10de  NVIDIA Corporation
	2504  GA106 [GeForce RTX 3060 Lite Hash Rate]
		1458 403e  Gaming OC 12G
1af4  Red Hat, Inc.
	1041  Virtio 1.0 network device
	1042  Virtio 1.0 block device
	1043  Virtio 1.0 console
	1044  Virtio 1.0 RNG
	1045  Virtio 1.0 balloon
	1053  Virtio 1.0 socket
	105a  Virtio 1.0 file system

